 "readme": {
  "file": "README.md",
  "title": "The General Courtade–Kumar theorem in Lean 4",
  "excerpt": "This repository contains a complete, machine-checked Lean 4 proof of the general Courtade–Kumar inequality: for every n, every Boolean function f on {0,1}ⁿ and every crossover probability p ∈ [0, 1], the mutual information between f(X) and the output Y of a binary symmetric channel with crossover p satisfies I(f(X); Y) ≤ 1 − H(p)."
 },
